---
---
<section class="about" id="about">
  <div class="container about-inner">
    <div data-animate>
      <div class="mono lbl">02 — About</div>
      <h2 class="about-h2">Large-scale rigor, applied to teams that deserve better tools.</h2>
      <p>I'm based in Hawai&#699;i, working with clients across the US. My background is in large-scale marketing operations and production — programs at Nike and Apple that touched millions of people.</p>
      <p>Now I bring that same discipline to smaller teams: real products, built properly, designed to grow. You work directly with me — no account managers, no handoffs, no runaround.</p>
      <div class="logos"><span>Nike</span><span>Apple</span><span>Independent</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="portrait" data-animate data-delay="1">
      <img src="/images/about-headshot.jpg" alt="Shauna" loading="lazy" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about { background: var(--primary-deep); color: var(--on-dark); padding: var(--section-py) 0; position: relative; z-index: 2; }
  .about-inner { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 4.5rem; align-items: center; }
  .about .lbl { color: var(--on-dark-3); }
  .about-h2 { font-family: var(--font-display); font-weight: 400; font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 3.6vw, 2.6rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 1.375rem 0 1.5rem; }
  .about p { color: var(--on-dark-2); font-size: 1.03rem; max-width: 46ch; margin-bottom: 1.125rem; }
  .logos { margin-top: 1.875rem; display: flex; gap: 1.75rem; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; }
  .logos span { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 1.25rem; color: var(--on-dark); font-weight: 500; }
  .portrait { aspect-ratio: 3/4; border-radius: var(--radius); overflow: hidden; background: linear-gradient(150deg,#2b2e31,rgba(23,25,27,0.5)); border: 1px solid var(--on-dark-line); }
  .portrait img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; display: block; }
  @media (max-width: 860px) { .about-inner { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 2.5rem; } .portrait { max-width: 320px; } }
</style>
